{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/promethean-the-created-aa/808822-exp-costs-for-prometheans-in-the-gmc","id":808822,"title":"EXP costs for Prometheans in the GMC","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Promethean: The Created"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-01-14T10:36:22-08:00","id":808822,"title":"EXP costs for Prometheans in the GMC","content":"Since 2e got rid of scaling xp costs, I'm wondering if there's an official errata or whatever for what Prometheans pay for their goodies. 5 xp for your power stat seems to be the norm, but transmutations don't really translate very well to the costs that vamps and were's have been paying for their gifts and disciplines. 3 xp for your affinity, again, seems to be the norm, but transmutations don't follow the same 5 dots, each one is a new power, structure that most other powers do.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10984-neckbeard-the-pirate","name":"Neckbeard the Pirate","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"47"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-14T11:38:16-08:00","id":808892,"title":"","content":"You can convert experience costs from 1e by finding the average experience cost for one dot and dividing by 5 (rounding to the nearest whole number as necessary)<br /> <br /> For example, in-clan Disciplines for vampires cost 5x new dot experience. The total cost to raise a Discipline from 1 to 5 was 75. We can divide that by five to get the average cost of a dot (15) and then divide by 5 again to get the 2e exp cost (3).<br /> <br /> Power stat costs are the exception because, frankly, 8x new dot for a 1-10 trait was ridiculous, so they decreased it significantly to make power stats more affordable in 2e.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Going by Willow now, or Wil for short. She/Her/Hers.","edited":{"userid":269,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","user":"Charlaquin","date":". 01-14-2016, 02:42 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","name":"Charlaquin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar269_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10831"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-14T16:30:59-08:00","id":809190,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Charlaquin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/promethean-the-created-aa/808822-exp-costs-for-prometheans-in-the-gmc?p=808892#post808892\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">You can convert experience costs from 1e by finding the average experience cost for one dot and dividing by 5 (rounding to the nearest whole number as necessary)<br /> <br /> For example, in-clan Disciplines for vampires cost 5x new dot experience. The total cost to raise a Discipline from 1 to 5 was 75. We can divide that by five to get the average cost of a dot (15) and then divide by 5 again to get the 2e exp cost (3).<br /> <br /> Power stat costs are the exception because, frankly, 8x new dot for a 1-10 trait was ridiculous, so they decreased it significantly to make power stats more affordable in 2e.</div> </div> </div> </div>Nothing that for my own 2E Conversions.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u2022 <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/806810-deionscribe-s-homebrew-hub#post806810\" target=\"_blank\">&quot;My Homebrew Hub&quot;</a><br /> \u2022 <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/828132-open-invite-age-of-azar\" target=\"_blank\">Age of Azar</a><br /> \u2022 <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/907224-the-kingdom-of-yamatai-dark-era\" target=\"_blank\">The Kingdom of Yamatai</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8180-deionscribe","name":"Deionscribe","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2265"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-14T16:40:32-08:00","id":809202,"title":"","content":"Also, a good shortcut is that for anything rated 0-5, the average cost will be the same as the cost of the 3rd dot.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Going by Willow now, or Wil for short. She/Her/Hers.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","name":"Charlaquin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar269_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10831"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-14T17:06:18-08:00","id":809226,"title":"","content":"Note the way the spoilers for Contracts in Changeling 2e price their powers, and why. For my quick-and-dirty conversion of Promethean to 2e rules, I treat each Transmutation as a separate power, and charge 1 Experience per dot, plus one more Experience if it's not Affinity.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"> <div align=\"center\">My hacks: <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwtrin\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Trinity Continuum</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwscion\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008000\">Scion</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwExalt\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520\">Exalted</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwcwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#800000\">World of Darkness</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwnwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Chronicles of Darkness</span></a></div> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","name":"Dataweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar421_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8420"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}